436 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Ability Scores\056 Your Wisdom Score increases by 2 and your Dexterity increases by 1\056\nAge\056 A Glidette reaches adulthood at the age of 15 and generally lives to be no more than a century old\056\nAlignment\056 Most Glidette are chaotic good\056 Generally\054 a Glidette will interfere in situations that strike them as unjust\054 and have no tolerance for oppression\056 They do not\054 however\054 believe in any modern form of laws or rules\073 rather\054 they act based on what they feel is right for nature or their family\056\nSize\056 Glidette heights range from 3\0470\042 to 4\0476\042 tall and weigh around 40 to 60 pounds\056 Your size is Small\056\nSpeed\056 Your base walking speed is 30 feet\056 You have a climbing speed of 30 feet\056\nLesser Darkvision\056 Accustomed to life in dark forest canopies\054 you can see in dim light within 30 feet of you as if it were bright light\054 and in darkness as if it were dim light\056 You cannot discern color in darkness\054 only shades of gray\056\nLanguages\056 You can speak\054 read\054 and write Common and Sylvan\056\nSmall Scamperer\056 You can move through the space of any creature that is a size larger than your own\056\nAerial Acrobat\056 When you fall and are not incapacitated or wearing heavy armor\054 you can use your reaction to extend your membranes and glide\056 While gliding\054 you gain the following benefits\072\nControlled Descent\056 You descend at a rate of 60 feet per round and take no fall damage when you land\056\nHorizontal Drift\056 For every 1 foot you descend\054 you can move up to 2 feet horizontally\054 which doesn\031t count against your movement\056\nEvasive Gliding\056 Ranged weapon attacks against you have disadvantage while you are in the air\056\nWhile gliding\054 you cannot make attacks or cast spells\056 You can stop gliding at any time during your descent\054 falling normally from that point onward\056\nLeaps and Bounds\056 When you make a long jump or a high jump\054 you can cover a distance equal to a running jump without needing to move 10 feet beforehand\056 You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Dexterity modifier \050a minimum of once\051\056 You regain all expended uses when you finish a short or long rest\056\nUnique Body Shape\056 Due to your gliding membranes and unique anatomy\054 standard armor and clothing do not fit you\056 You can only wear armor or clothing specifically tailored for a Glidette\054 which costs twice as much as normal\056 Armor modified in this way functions as normal and weighs the standard amount\056 A Glidette wearing armor not specifically tailored for a Glidette loses their Small Scamperer\054 Aerial Acrobat\054 and Leaps and Bounds abilities\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 437 0 R
     /Pg 430 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

